    "tariffLines": "Indian financial year, April to March",
    "statement": "UN Comtrade reports calendar years and DGCIS reports Indian financial years. HStat keeps them in separate blocks and labels every figure with its own basis. They are never summed, spliced or plotted on a shared axis; where the page shows both, it is showing two adjacent measurements of overlapping but different periods."
